# This repository tracks the workspace layout and the updater, not the clones
# inside it. Every group folder holds independent repositories that ./update.sh
# refreshes, so nothing below a group is tracked except its .gitkeep marker.
# Adding a group means adding one line here plus a .gitkeep in it.
*
!/.gitignore
!/update.sh
!/harnesses/
!/mine/
!/pi-ecosystem/
!/pi-ecosystem/forks/
!/pipelines/
!/skills/
!.gitkeep
